<title>JAPAN: Tobishima shares down on sector worries.</title>
<headline>Tobishima shares down on sector worries.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Tobishima Corp dropped sharply on Thursday afternoon amid lingering worries over estimated heavy bad loans in the construction sector, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price of the top construction firm was down 27 yen at 220 yen at 0531 GMT, after tumbling to 205 yen. It was the sixth largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
